### Create a reminder for a medicine
POST http://localhost:8030/reminder/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "medicineId": "a3d50111-4b45-4ec9-8806-8f4e03a31438",
  "time": "08:00",
  "frequency": "DAILY",
  "dayOfWeek": null,
  "startDate": "2025-11-25T12:50:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-01-10T08:00:00Z",
  "vibrate": true
}

###

### Create a weekly reminder (specific days)
POST http://localhost:8030/reminder/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "medicineId": "2a8d3f5a-add7-42ca-9c40-4dbf62519486",
  "time": "14:30",
  "frequency": "WEEKLY",
  "dayOfWeek": ["MONDAY", "WEDNESDAY", "FRIDAY"],
  "startDate": "2025-01-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-03-01T08:00:00Z",
  "vibrate": false
}

###

### Create a custom frequency reminder
POST http://localhost:8030/reminder/create
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "medicineId": "2a8d3f5a-add7-42ca-9c40-4dbf62519486",
  "time": "20:00",
  "frequency": "CUSTOM",
  "dayOfWeek": ["TUESDAY", "THURSDAY", "SATURDAY"],
  "startDate": "2025-01-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2025-06-01T08:00:00Z",
  "vibrate": true
}

###
